2026-09-29T19:10:11.018855+00:00  Usage: soup data doctor [OPTIONS] PATH                                         
2026-09-29T19:10:11.018876+00:00                                                                                 
2026-09-29T19:10:11.022937+00:00  Chat-template compatibility report + loss-mask X-ray.                          
2026-09-29T19:10:11.022964+00:00                                                                                 
2026-09-29T19:10:11.022978+00:00  Catches the top *silent* fine-tune failures before a single training           
2026-09-29T19:10:11.022990+00:00  step: missing/incompatible chat_template, missing EOS in the trained           
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023002+00:00  span (the #1 "model never stops generating" bug), duplicated BOS,              
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023012+00:00  unsupported system role, unknown message roles, and truncation risk.           
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023034+00:00  Pass --show-mask N to render N sample rows with per-token                      
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023044+00:00  trained/masked colouring through the real answer-only / per-message /          
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023054+00:00  RAFT span-mask collator path.                                                  
2026-09-29T19:10:11.023063+00:00                                                                                 
